#: plugins/mqtt/src/plugin.vala:1337
msgid ""
"ℹ Server: ejabberd (mod_mqtt detected)\n"
"\n"
"ejabberd shares XMPP and MQTT authentication.\n"
"You can use your XMPP credentials to connect\n"
"to the MQTT broker on the same domain.\n"
"\n"
"Per-account mode uses these credentials automatically."
msgstr ""
"ℹ Server: ejabberd (zistený mod_mqtt)\n"
"\n"
"ejabberd zdieľa overovanie totožnosti XMPP a MQTT.\n"
"Na pripojenie k brokerovi MQTT v rovnakej doméne\n"
"môžete použiť svoje prihlasovacie údaje XMPP.\n"
"\n"
"Režim pre jednotlivé účty používa tieto údaje automaticky."

#: plugins/mqtt/src/plugin.vala:1345
msgid ""
"⚠ Server: Prosody (mod_pubsub_mqtt detected)\n"
"\n"
"Prosody's MQTT bridge does NOT support authentication.\n"
"Any client on the network can subscribe to topics.\n"
"\n"
"Recommendations:\n"
"• Restrict MQTT port via firewall\n"
"• Use TLS for encryption\n"
"• Do not publish sensitive data\n"
"\n"
"Topic format: <HOST>/<TYPE>/<NODE>"
msgstr ""
"⚠ Server: Prosody (zistený mod_pubsub_mqtt)\n"
"\n"
"Premostenie MQTT v Prosody NEPODPORUJE overenie totožnosti.\n"
"Témy môže odoberať ktorýkoľvek klient v sieti.\n"
"\n"
"Odporúčania:\n"
"• Obmedzte port MQTT pomocou firewallu\n"
"• Používajte TLS na šifrovanie\n"
"• Nepublikujte citlivé údaje\n"
"\n"
"Formát témy: <HOST>/<TYPE>/<NODE>"

